{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"c0c869649a182655684443ec9b17c56f47aa3a78b3c03a0a3530ab728c8ff579","digest":{"component_or_area":"outbound dispatch and cross-project validation","key_entities":["_bridge_target_project","OutboundDiffConfig","resolve_project","projects_store.load_mapping","_cross_project_targets","outbound_differ.py","run_differs.py","acli.py","jira_datacenter/_issues.py","applier.py","projects_store.py","_BRIDGE_ONLY_CREATE_FIELDS","_translate_create_fields","dispatch_one.create_one"],"problem_keywords":["multi-project outbound dispatch","cross-project guard","set membership","outbound sync","project resolution"],"propositions":["Outbound create mutations must resolve and target the ticket's project from the store mapping rather than a single construction-time client default.","The cross-project guard must relax from strict equality to set membership, validating that target keys belong to the configured mapping's project set.","Create mutations targeting projects absent from the mapping must emit no mutation to prevent stale or typo bindings from creating against unsynced projects.","The Data Center transport must drop the reserved _bridge_target_project key before sending create fields to Jira to prevent field validation errors.","Both Cloud and Data Center transports must read the target project from the create mutation payload and fall back to their construction-time default for legacy single-project compatibility."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787905905194810001,"uuid":"8d7e5231-68c4-4381-aa44-ff8009bb4215"}